    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3255" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκνησ-τις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spine</i> or <i>backbone</i> of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.161
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ κνῆστιν</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1403
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μέσον τῆς ὀσφύος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.179
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stinging-nettle</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκαλήφη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				52
			</span></i> (other expl. ap. Sch. ad loc.).</div>
